  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Flowminder Foundation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Using mobile operator, geospatial and survey data, Flowminder focus is on improving the wellbeing of vulnerable populations in low- and middle-income countries. They provide information and capacity strengthening to governments, mobile network operators, national and international agencies and researchers in low- and middle-income countries for humanitarian and development purposes. 

FCDO  funding will support two main workstreams: (1) Population Mobility Data and (2) Geospatial analysis for decision-making. The range of activities that will be funded include: (a) data analysis of datasets, both traditional (survey) and novel (Mobile Phone Data); (b) stakeholder engagement at global and local levels; (c) training and capacity building of end users to use data effectively for evidence-based decision making.</narrative>
  </description>
